    "notes": [
      "Comprehensive Bug Hunt Remediation Roadmap Phase 1 r2 overlay; supersedes the failed first Phase 1 artifact.",
      "Room schema advances from 14 to 15 for separated observed, claimed, and verified external-command authorization metadata.",
      "Query redaction is structural: credential query values are redacted, public values are preserved, encoded credential names are covered, and substring false positives are regression-tested.",
